      "search:sku": "001K-03884",
      "search:title": "2019-nCoV E gene stabilized RNA as positive control: shipping at Room Temperature",
      "search:description": "Lyophilized encapsidated RNA for SARS-CoV-2 (2019-nCoV) real time RT-PCR targeting region of the E gene, for 100 Rxns (Target designed by Charité Universitätsmedizin Berlin ; https://www.who.int/docs/default-source/coronaviruse/wuhan-virus-assay-v1991527e5122341d99287a1b17c111902.pdf). \r\nThe encapsidated RNA has been stabilized to serve as positive control for extraction and real time RT-PCR. Extraction is mandatory before use in real time RT-PCR. SOPs in the attached pdf. \r\nFor RUO (Research Use Only)",
